{:org/id :org-global-creator-membership-communities
 :org/name "Creator membership communities (Patreon, Fanbox, Twitch subs, fan funding)"
 :org/entity-kind :org-form
 :org/form-family :family-fan-club
 :org/category :cat-online
 :org/type :secular-community
 :org/scope :global
 :org/region-primary :region-north-america
 :org/countries ["US" "JP" "GB" "DE" "BR" "KR" "PL"]
 :org/founding-date 2013
 :org/instance-count-estimate 286287
 :org/member-count 10000000
 :org/member-count-basis "source-pinned for one platform: Patreon reports 286,287 creators with at least one paying member as of February 2026 — DOWN about 5% since June 2025 — against 25 million+ paid memberships and 10 million+ people paying monthly, plus 60 million+ free memberships. Memberships exceed paying people because one person subscribes to several creators, so the corpus records the ~10M payer figure and not the 25M membership figure. Fanbox, Twitch subscriptions and other platforms are separate and not included."
 :org/proxy-metric "platform-reported paid memberships and creator accounts"
 :org/proxy-bias "Memberships overstate people (one payer, several creators). Free memberships overstate again by an order of magnitude. The creator count includes anyone with a single paying member, so it counts the long tail as communities of one."
 :org/legal-registration :unregistered
 :org/registration-note "The community lives entirely inside a company's account system: if the platform closes the account, the community has no roll, no treasury and no way to reassemble — the same dependency the subscription fan club has on an agency."
 :org/governance-model :hierarchical
 :org/mission-statement "Paying audiences with tiered access to a creator's work, chat and events — the direct successor to the subscription fan club, disintermediated from the agency but re-intermediated by the platform."
 :org/related-org "org-jpn-artist-fan-clubs"
 :org/source-name "Patreon platform statistics compilations (2025-2026)"
 :org/source-url "https://backlinko.com/patreon-users"
 :org/source-date "2026-02"
 :org/source-tier :secondary
 :org/source-caveat "Third-party compilations of Patreon data; Patreon does not publish a standard statistical report."
 :org/pinned-on "2026-07-26"
 :org/data-provenance "source-pinned"
 :source/dataset "community-coverage"}

